{"fetchedAt":"2026-09-28T12:55:30.311Z","overview":{"Symbol":"MRP","Name":"Millrose Properties, Inc.","Description":"Millrose Properties, Inc. is the premier permanent capital solution for residential homebuilders and developers. The company specializes in the acquisition, financing and development of residential land through long-term, capital-efficient structures. The company also provides homebuilders with a predictable, just-in-time supply of finished homesites  the scarcest and mission-critical resource in the homebuilding industry. Millrose utilizes a proprietary technology platform that provides real-time feedback and data analytics to drive acquisition decisions. Every transaction in the Millrose portfolio undergoes rigorous independent due diligence to ensure attractive yields and long-term viability. By enabling an asset-light model, Millrose provides its diverse roster of homebuilder partners with the strategic flexibility to maintain production volumes and optimize balance sheet efficiency across all market environments. Millrose Properties, Inc.is based in Miami, United States.","CIK":"","Exchange":"NYSE","Currency":"USD","Country":"United States","Sector":"Real Estate","Industry":"REIT - Residential","Address":"600 Brickell Avenue, Miami, FL, 33131, United States","FiscalYearEnd":"","LatestQuarter":"","MarketCapitalization":"4514843136","EBITDA":"","PERatio":"9.473868","PEGRatio":"","BookValue":"35.242","DividendPerShare":"3.16","DividendYield":"0.1162","EPS":"2.87","RevenuePerShareTTM":"4.581","ProfitMargin":"0.62595004","OperatingMarginTTM":"0.85156995","ReturnOnAssetsTTM":"0.045760002","ReturnOnEquityTTM":"0.081199996","RevenueTTM":"760542016","GrossProfitTTM":"648793984","DilutedEPSTTM":"2.87","QuarterlyEarningsGrowthYOY":"0.116","QuarterlyRevenueGrowthYOY":"0.321","AnalystTargetPrice":"37.16667","TrailingPE":"9.473868","ForwardPE":"8.409287","PriceToSalesRatioTTM":"5.9363494","PriceToBookRatio":"0.77152264","EVToRevenue":"9.168","EVToEBITDA":"","